{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2021-02-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES NAMES ADRIANE M. BROWN TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "FORT WORTH, TEXAS, FEB. 22, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMERICAN AIRLINES GROUP INC. (NASDAQ: AAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF ADRIANE M. BROWN, 62, TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. BROWN WILL ALSO SERVE ON THE COMPANY'S AUDIT AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE AND PUBLIC RESPONSIBILITY COMMITTEES."}